order-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/One_warm_prawn.\" title=\"One warm prawn.\">One warm prawn.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/H.\" title=\"H.\">H.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>BMXing!</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">Series 6</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 23 May 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\">Russell Howard</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/BMXing!?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"BMXing!\" was an exclamation by <a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\">Liza Tarbuck</a> while she rode a BMX during the <a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_most_fun\" title=\"Have the most fun\">Have the most fun</a> task. The title card shows the tip of a can of squirty cream from the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_art_using_the_entire_contents_of_this_can_of_squirty_cream\" title=\"Make the best art using the entire contents of this can of squirty cream\">Make the best art using the entire contents of this can of squirty cream</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/BMXing!?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'BMX'e!', which translates as 'BMXing!'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'BMX:äilyä!', which translates as 'BMXing!'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/BMXing!?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alice Levine</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Asim_Chaudhry\" title=\"Asim Chaudhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Asim Chaudhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Liza Tarbuck</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Russell Howard</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Tim Vine</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_thought-provoking_thing\" title=\"Most thought-provoking thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most thought-provoking thing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_something_manly_with_this_cardboard_box\" title=\"Do something manly with this cardboard box\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do something manly with this cardboard box.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_most_fun\" title=\"Have the most fun\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Have the most fun.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Exactly recreate your attempt at the first task.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_art_using_the_entire_contents_of_this_can_of_squirty_cream\" title=\"Make the best art using the entire contents of this can of squirty cream\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best art using the entire contents of this can of squirty cream.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_the_%C2%A35_note_from_under_the_pint_without_spilling_any_of_the_pint\" title=\"Remove the £5 note from under the pint without spilling any of the pint\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Remove the £5 note from under the pint without spilling any of the pint. If you spill any of the pint, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Shake_hands_with_the_Taskmaster_without_revealing_your_identities\" title=\"Shake hands with the Taskmaster without revealing your identities\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> When tapped on the shoulder, shake hands with the Taskmaster without revealing your identities. You may not speak during the task. Everyone must shake hands with the Taskmaster once for at least 2 seconds. If the Taskmaster guesses your identity, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>23\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>24</b>\n</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/BMXing!?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_6,_Episode_4_-_Full_Episode_-_%27BMXing%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/46/Taskmaster_-_Series_6%2C_Episode_4_-_Full_Episode_-_%27BMXing%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35